  "description": "APL.Net (Another Parallel Library): high-performance data-parallel primitives for .NET. Struct-invoker loops the JIT devirtualizes and inlines, static/striped/work-stealing partitioning on the thread pool without ExecutionContext flow, zero-allocation steady state, Vector128/256/512 SIMD kernels, a pointer tier and a source generator. NativeAOT-safe. Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
